1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,433
Ow! Ow!

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:03,267
Cramp! Help!

3
00:00:03,267 --> 00:00:05,133
- June.
- She's faking it.

4
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:07,733
Just like everything
about her is fake.

5
00:00:07,733 --> 00:00:09,033
Help!

6
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:11,200
- I'm coming!
- [WATER SPLASHES]

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,133
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

8
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:14,233
Ow!

9
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:16,667
- [PING] I got you.
- [JUNE] Ow!

10
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:18,233
- [PING] Wait.
- [JUNE] Ow!

11
00:00:18,233 --> 00:00:20,100
[PING] Just relax, okay?

12
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,633
[JUNE] That hurt! Ouch!

13
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:23,067
[PING] Just relax.

14
00:00:23,067 --> 00:00:24,633
[PING HUFFS]

15
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:26,733
- [PING] Where does it hurt?
- [JUNE] This foot.

16
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:27,733
[PING] Wait.

17
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:31,267
- Ow! Ow!
- [PING] Relax.

18
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:35,467
[JUNE] Oh, my god.

19
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:39,267
<i>I would've shaved my legs if I
had known this would happen.</i>

20
00:00:39,267 --> 00:00:43,467
<i>He might think my skin
is made of sandpaper.</i>

21
00:00:43,467 --> 00:00:46,633
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

22
00:00:46,633 --> 00:00:53,633
[MUSIC BECOMES ROMANTIC]

23
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,533
[GIGGLING]

24
00:00:59,533 --> 00:01:00,767
- Ow!
- Oh!

25
00:01:01,467 --> 00:01:04,700
Sor-- Sorry, sorry, sorry!
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

26
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,700
I didn't mean to.
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

27
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,300
Why'd you hit me there?

28
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,367
- Sorry.
- Oh my god, sir!

29
00:01:10,367 --> 00:01:11,600
Do you need ice?

30
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,567
Just get my stuff.
Just get my stuff, hurry.

31
00:01:15,567 --> 00:01:16,533
I'll get it.

32
00:01:18,567 --> 00:01:21,133
[PING GROANS]

33
00:01:21,133 --> 00:01:26,533
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

34
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:27,533
[MUSIC STOPS]

35
00:01:29,433 --> 00:01:35,400
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

36
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,567
Why do you have
my birth certificate?

37
00:01:37,567 --> 00:01:40,433
And also Ima's, my uncle's,
and my cousins'?

38
00:01:40,467 --> 00:01:41,533
Huh?

39
00:01:41,533 --> 00:01:43,733
Are you having me
investigated?

40
00:01:46,767 --> 00:01:49,067
This isn't part of our
agreement.

41
00:01:51,367 --> 00:01:53,367
- Come here.
- Hey! What are you doing?!

42
00:01:53,367 --> 00:01:55,333
I might fall!

43
00:01:55,333 --> 00:02:02,267
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]
